# Workflow Execution Engine

<details>
<summary>Relevant source files</summary>

The following files were used as context for generating this wiki page:

- [backend/src/schedules/schedules.service.ts](backend/src/schedules/schedules.service.ts)
- [backend/src/temporal/temporal.service.ts](backend/src/temporal/temporal.service.ts)
- [worker/src/temporal/activities/mcp.activity.ts](worker/src/temporal/activities/mcp.activity.ts)
- [worker/src/temporal/types.ts](worker/src/temporal/types.ts)
- [worker/src/temporal/workers/dev.worker.ts](worker/src/temporal/workers/dev.worker.ts)
