## Core Data Structure

Dynamic ports are stored in the workflow graph node data:

```typescript
// Stored on FrontendNodeData
{
  dynamicInputs?: Array<{
    id: string;
    label: string;
    connectionType: ConnectionType;
    description?: string;
    required?: boolean;
    // ... other port metadata
  }>;
  dynamicOutputs?: Array<{
    id: string;
    label: string;
    connectionType: ConnectionType;
    description?: string;
    // ... other port metadata
  }>;
}
```

These arrays supplement (not replace) the static ports defined in component metadata. When rendering or validating connections, the system merges static and dynamic ports.

