## Runtime Type Mapping

The `runtimeInputTypeToConnectionType` function maps Entry Point runtime input types to connection types:

| Runtime Input Type | Connection Type | Notes |
|-------------------|-----------------|-------|
| `text`, `string` | `{ kind: 'primitive', name: 'text' }` | Standard text |
| `number` | `{ kind: 'primitive', name: 'number' }` | Numeric values |
| `boolean` | `{ kind: 'primitive', name: 'boolean' }` | True/false |
| `json` | `{ kind: 'primitive', name: 'json' }` | JSON objects |
| `file` | `{ kind: 'primitive', name: 'file' }` | File references |
| `secret` | `{ kind: 'primitive', name: 'secret' }` | Secret references |
| `array` | `{ kind: 'list', element: { kind: 'primitive', name: 'text' } }` | List of strings |
| `credential` | `{ kind: 'contract', name: '__runtime.credential__', credential: true }` | Credential contract |
| `credential:provider` | `{ kind: 'contract', name: 'provider', credential: true }` | Provider-specific credential |
| `contract:name` | `{ kind: 'contract', name: 'name' }` | Custom contract |

