## SSE Delivery to Frontend

Terminal chunks are streamed to the frontend via Server-Sent Events (SSE) with cursor-based resumption support.

### SSE Event Format

```json
event: terminal
data: {
  "cursor": "1234567890-0",
  "chunks": [
    {
      "nodeRef": "node-abc",
      "stream": "stdout",
      "chunkIndex": 42,
      "payload": "Processing file...\n",
      "recordedAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:45.123Z",
      "deltaMs": 150
    }
  ]
}
```

