## Frontend Terminal State Management

The execution store maintains terminal streams indexed by `nodeRef:stream` keys, deduplicating chunks and tracking sequence positions.

### Terminal State Schema

```typescript
// frontend/src/store/executionStore.ts:86-92
export interface TerminalStreamState {
  nodeRef: string;
  stream: string;
  cursor: string | null;
  chunks: TerminalStreamChunk[];
  lastChunkIndex: number;
}
```

### Chunk Deduplication and Ordering

```mermaid
graph TB
    SSE["SSE 'terminal' Event"]
    Handler["Event Handler"]
    Dedup["Deduplication<br/>chunkIndex > lastChunkIndex"]
    Merge["Merge Chunks"]
    Trim["Trim to MAX_TERMINAL_CHUNKS"]
    State["terminalStreams Map"]

    SSE --> Handler
    Handler --> Dedup
    Dedup -->|"new chunks"| Merge
    Dedup -->|"duplicate"| Skip["Skip"]
    Merge --> Trim
    Trim --> State

    style Dedup fill:#f9f9f9
    style State fill:#f9f9f9
```

The SSE handler processes incoming terminal chunks with deduplication:

```typescript
// frontend/src/store/executionStore.ts:472-550
source.addEventListener('terminal', (event) => {
  const payload = JSON.parse(event.data);

  set((state) => {
    const streams = { ...state.terminalStreams };

    for (const chunk of payload.chunks) {
      const key = terminalKey(chunk.nodeRef, chunk.stream);
      const existing = streams[key] ?? {
        nodeRef: chunk.nodeRef,
        stream: chunk.stream,
        cursor: null,
        chunks: [],
        lastChunkIndex: 0,
      };

      // Skip duplicates
      if (chunk.chunkIndex <= existing.lastChunkIndex) {
        continue;
      }

      // Append and trim
      const merged = [...existing.chunks, chunk];
      const trimmed = merged.length > MAX_TERMINAL_CHUNKS 
        ? merged.slice(-MAX_TERMINAL_CHUNKS) 
        : merged;

      streams[key] = {
        ...existing,
        chunks: trimmed,
        lastChunkIndex: chunk.chunkIndex,
      };
    }

    return {
      terminalStreams: streams,
      terminalCursor: payload.cursor ?? state.terminalCursor,
    };
  });
});
```

**MAX_TERMINAL_CHUNKS = 500** to prevent unbounded memory growth in the frontend.

**Sources:** [frontend/src/store/executionStore.ts:94,472-550]()

