## Purpose and Scope

This document describes the frontend API client architecture used to communicate with the NestJS backend. It covers the OpenAPI specification generation, type-safe client creation, authentication middleware, and the `api` facade layer that provides a unified interface for all backend operations.

For state management patterns that consume this API client, see [State Management](#6.2). For authentication and authorization flows, see [Authentication and Authorization](#6.4).

