## Type Safety Benefits

The architecture provides end-to-end type safety:

### Backend Controller to Frontend Component

```typescript
// Backend: Controller defines response type
@ApiOkResponse({ type: WorkflowResponseDto })
async findOne(@Param('id') id: string): Promise<WorkflowResponseDto> {
  return this.workflowsService.findById(id, auth);
}

// OpenAPI Schema Generated
{
  "/api/v1/workflows/{id}": {
    "get": {
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WorkflowResponseDto" }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

// TypeScript Types Generated
