### Activity Proxy Configuration

Workflows invoke activities via `proxyActivities`, which provides type-safe proxies with timeout and retry configurations. Different activity groups use different timeout settings based on their expected execution duration.

| Activity Group | Timeout | Retry Policy | Example Activities |
