| Run Preparation | 2 minutes | Default | `prepareRunPayloadActivity` |
| Trace Recording | 1 minute | Default | `recordTraceEventActivity` |
| MCP Registration | 10 minutes | Default | `registerLocalMcpActivity` |
| Tool Discovery | Varies | Default | `discoverMcpToolsActivity` |

