### areAllToolsReadyActivity

Polls the tool registry to verify that all required tool nodes have completed registration and are ready for use. AI agent nodes use this activity to wait for dependent tools before starting execution.

The workflow implements a polling loop with 2-second intervals and a 2-minute timeout:

```typescript
const MAX_WAIT_TIME_MS = 120000; // 2 minutes
const POLL_INTERVAL_MS = 2000;   // 2 seconds

while (Date.now() - startTime < MAX_WAIT_TIME_MS) {
  const readyCheck = await areAllToolsReadyActivity({
    runId: input.runId,
    requiredNodeIds: nodeMetadata.connectedToolNodeIds,
  });
  if (readyCheck.ready) break;
  await sleep(POLL_INTERVAL_MS);
}
```

**Sources:** [worker/src/temporal/workflows/index.ts:798-840]()

