## Run Lifecycle Activities

### prepareRunPayloadActivity

Prepares a workflow run payload by fetching the workflow definition, resolving version (latest or specific), validating inputs against the entry point schema, and generating unique identifiers (`runId`, `temporalRunId`).

This activity is critical for sub-workflow calls, where the parent workflow delegates payload preparation to an activity rather than doing it in the deterministic workflow context.

