## Example: Approval Gate Flow

Complete example of a manual approval gate in a workflow:

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Scheduler as Workflow Scheduler
    participant Workflow as shipsecWorkflowRun
    participant Activity as Activities
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant User as Approver
    participant Backend as Backend API

    Note over Scheduler,Workflow: Execution reaches approval node
    Scheduler->>Workflow: run(actionRef="manual-approval")
    Workflow->>Activity: runComponentActivity({componentId: "manual.approval", ...})
    Activity-->>Workflow: {output: {pending: true, title: "Approve deploy", timeoutAt: "..."}}

    Workflow->>Workflow: isApprovalPending() = true
    Workflow->>Activity: createHumanInputRequestActivity({runId, nodeRef, inputType: "approval", ...})
    Activity->>DB: INSERT INTO human_input_requests
    Activity-->>Workflow: {requestId: "uuid-123", resolveToken: "secret", resolveUrl: "https://..."}

    Note over Workflow: Workflow blocks waiting for signal
    Workflow->>Workflow: condition(() => humanInputResolutions.has("manual-approval"), 300000)

    Note over User,Backend: User reviews request
    User->>Backend: GET /human-inputs (lists pending requests)
    Backend->>DB: SELECT * FROM human_input_requests WHERE status='pending'
    DB-->>Backend: [{id: "uuid-123", title: "Approve deploy", ...}]
    Backend-->>User: Pending requests

    User->>Backend: POST /human-inputs/uuid-123/resolve<br/>{approved: true, responseNote: "LGTM"}
    Backend->>DB: UPDATE human_input_requests SET status='resolved'
    Backend->>Backend: temporalClient.signalWorkflow(runId, resolveHumanInputSignal, {...})

    Note over Workflow: Signal received, condition() returns
    Workflow->>Workflow: Extract resolution from humanInputResolutions Map
    Workflow->>Workflow: results.set("manual-approval", {approved: true, respondedBy: "...", ...})
    Workflow->>Workflow: Determine activePorts = ["approved", "respondedBy", ...]
    Workflow-->>Scheduler: {activePorts: ["approved", ...]}

    Note over Scheduler: Only nodes connected to "approved" port execute
    Scheduler->>Workflow: run(nextActionRef="deploy-to-prod")
```

